---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">Dual Brain Robotics — last updated November 20, 2026.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      This website does not collect personal information automatically. There are no user
      accounts, no contact forms, no analytics, and no advertising trackers on this site.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you contact us by email, we receive the address and message you send and use them
      only to reply to you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no cookies of its own. Some pages embed videos from YouTube, which is
      operated by Google. Google may set its own cookies when those videos are loaded;
      Google's own privacy policy describes how it handles that.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>
      The only third-party service used on this site is YouTube, for embedded videos. We do
      not run advertising and we do not use data brokers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Sharing and selling</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell, rent, or trade personal information. We do not share correspondence
      with third parties except as required by law.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      Because we hold no account data, there is nothing to correct or delete outside of our
      email correspondence. To ask about information we hold, email us at the address below.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      This site is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect information
      from children.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes, the revised version will be posted on this page with an
      updated date.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:alex.durig@gmail.com">alex.durig@gmail.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>

</MainLayout>
